  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "**Some \"Permanent\" Tome Points **\nThese are points that once done you either reached the cap or the current cap for a long time, nothing scaling like 3D Samples that just keeps going up.\n- Chaotic Efaunt, 1 sec. Enter with WW, walk just few steps left towards Cactus and use Whale Wallop skill (Manually, keyboard hotkey). This is RNG as there's 6 arms and the head, and the whales have to hit all arms AND then the head. do this a dozen times, most people manage 1 sec within 20 attempts.\n- 1mil + Bubbles\n- Most Vials maxed (962 needed but we hit like 1040ish+ if maxed)\n- Total Cards (1344+)\n- Unique Quests caps at 323\n- 500+ Vault upgrades\n- 22+ trophies found\n- 20+ Nametags found (harder since its more event/shop based)\n- 450+ Total Minigame highscore\n- Get all Star Signs\n- 107+ Unique Obols (also needed for the Slab)\n- Max Sigils (doesnt need new tier yet)\n- All prayers Maxed\n- 31 Equinox clouds done (think we have 34 + 1 being the killroy kills one)\n- Rift 49+\n- Onyx Statues 28+ (we have 32)\n- All sailing artifacts\n- Pure Memory (the wisdom \"click me\" in cave) to 13+\n- 120+ Farming crops (we have 280)\n- Golden food beanstalk 30+ (we have 47?)\n- Magic Bean trade of 210k+ \n- 100+ Emperor (w6 boss) kills\n- Coral Reef 37+ upgrades (we have 45+ atm)\n- Fastest Wave 100 Pet Battle. Make your Game UI Smaller, very small so you can barely still press start and use this setup: \nhttps://discord.com/channels/437797104786604034/1449575436840603750/1449575476644286525\n- Total Pet Breedability 500+ (200pts), all at level 7+ is 476 (191 pts) so getting a bunch to lvl 8 isn't terrible with WW active.\n- Total Shiny pet levels (cant reach max pts but you can only get them to level 20 each, so not terrible either with WW depending on your Cavern Lamp bonus)\n- Total Gambit time (this will increase with new buffs, but its a lot of points, so getting 20-30min+ timers on them is great)\n\n**Harder/Annoying:**\n- Spike Trap Round 13+ (this is RNG), 1-3 minutes before the hour hits, type \"If u love me let me go\" in game and it teleports you to spike minigame. (Stand bottom right, dont ask why, because it's lucky)\n- 10 Lava dev steams watched, reminder you need to receive the gem envelopes for this to count during the stream.\n- Fastest time reaching Wave 100\n- Best Wisdom Monument Run (18+)",
